OL,3,GNEWSACouncillors welcome 'crash black
OL,4,Aspot' road changes
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe decision to change the layout of a
OL,7,Fbusy town road after a number of
OL,8,Fserious crashes has been welcomed by
OL,9,Fcouncillors.
OL,11,FKings Road is one of the main outbound
OL,12,Froutes in Reading, sending drivers from
OL,13,Fthe town centre to Cemetery Junction
OL,14,Fand the A4 London Road.
OL,16,FThe road is a known crash black spot,
OL,17,Fwith three resulting in injuries
OL,18,Freported at the start of the year.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
