OL,3,GNEWSACouncillors welcome 'crash black
OL,4,Aspot' road changes
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe situation has been highlighted by
OL,7,FEleaonora Galli, whose son was
OL,8,Fseriously hurt when he was hit by a
OL,9,Ftaxi driver while he was crossing the
OL,10,Froad in May 2021.
